	(365, 54, 'Are you struck by a new thought? I was.', 413.334, 415.457, '''a'':5 ''are'':1 ''by'':4 ''i'':8 ''new'':6 ''struck'':3 ''thought'':7 ''was'':9 ''you'':2'),
	(907, 76, 'it''s from the Latin word "cor,"
