	(543, 54, 'if she comes in, I get annoyed.', 867.567, 869.257, '''annoyed'':7 ''comes'':3 ''get'':6 ''i'':5 ''if'':1 ''in'':4 ''she'':2'),
	(911, 76, 'They had the compassion to be kind
