	(914, 76, 'if we can''t treat ourselves kindly.', 562.114, 563.857, '''can'':3 ''if'':1 ''kindly'':7 ''ourselves'':6 ''t'':4 ''treat'':5 ''we'':2'),
	(915, 76, 'And the last was they had connection,
