	(392, 54, 'This was the love of his life, Sarah.', 486.880, 489.737, '''his'':6 ''life'':7 ''love'':4 ''of'':5 ''sarah'':8 ''the'':3 ''this'':1 ''was'':2'),
	(2596, 81, 'He said, "If you''re in the top 25%
