	(3318, 85, 'I''ve walked into PE meetings where', 136.480, 139.920, '''i'':1 ''into'':4 ''meetings'':6 ''pe'':5 ''ve'':2 ''walked'':3 ''where'':7'),
	(1470, 77, 'but stories can also be used
