	(2745, 81, 'Standard of living is lower.', 602.566, 604.136, '''is'':4 ''living'':3 ''lower'':5 ''of'':2 ''standard'':1'),
	(1471, 77, 'Stories can break the dignity of a people,', 1068.802, 1071.136, '''a'':7 ''break'':3 ''can'':2 ''dignity'':5 ''of'':6 ''people'':8 ''stories'':1 ''the'':4'),
	(1472, 77, 'but stories can also repair
